<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Composition with Red, Blue and Yellow (1930) - Piet Mondrian</title>
<meta name="description" content="Piet Mondrian, Composition with Red, Blue and Yellow, 1930. De Stijl, Neoplasticism, and why its asymmetric balance still matters.">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Archivo+Black&family=Archivo:wght@400;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root{--red:#d6211f;--blue:#1f3f99;--yellow:#f4d21c;--black:#111;--white:#f6f4ee;--grey:#c9c9c4;--line:14px}
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0}
body{background:var(--black);color:var(--black);font:400 1.05rem/1.55 Archivo,system-ui,sans-serif}
a{color:inherit}
.grid{display:grid;gap:var(--line);padding:var(--line);min-height:100vh;
 grid-template-columns:1.1fr 2.4fr;grid-template-rows:2.4fr 1fr .5fr}
.c{background:var(--white);padding:clamp(1rem,3vw,2.5rem)}
.red{background:var(--red);color:var(--white);grid-column:2;grid-row:1/3;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:flex-end}
h1{font:400 clamp(2.2rem,6vw,5.5rem)/.95 "Archivo Black",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.02em}
.meta{grid-column:1;grid-row:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between;gap:1rem}
.meta b{font-family:"Archivo Black";font-size:clamp(2.5rem,5vw,4.5rem);line-height:1}
.blue{background:var(--blue);grid-column:1;grid-row:3}
.mid{grid-column:1;grid-row:2}
.bot{grid-column:2;grid-row:3;display:grid;grid-template-columns:4fr 1fr;gap:var(--line);padding:0;background:var(--black)}
.bot .c:last-child{background:var(--yellow)}
.label{font-weight:600;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.12em;font-size:.75rem}
section.story{display:grid;gap:var(--line);padding:0 var(--line) var(--line);grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(260px,1fr))}
section.story h2{font:400 1.5rem/1.1 "Archivo Black";margin:.4rem 0 .8rem}
.grey{background:var(--grey)}
.cta{background:var(--yellow);display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between;gap:1rem}
.cta a{display:inline-block;background:var(--black);color:var(--white);padding:.9rem 1.2rem;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;border:4px solid var(--black)}
.cta a:hover,.cta a:focus-visible{background:var(--red);outline:none}
footer{color:var(--grey);padding:0 var(--line) var(--line);font-size:.8rem}
@media (max-width:700px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 2fr;grid-template-rows:auto auto auto 80px}
 .red{grid-column:1/3;grid-row:1}.meta{grid-row:2;grid-column:1/3}.mid{grid-row:3;grid-column:1/3}.blue{grid-row:4}.bot{grid-row:4}}
</style>
</head>
