 <div class="c red"><span class="label">De Stijl</span><h1>Composition with Red, Blue and Yellow</h1></div>
 <div class="c mid"><p>Also listed as <em>Composition II in Red, Blue, and Yellow</em>.</p></div>
 <div class="blue" aria-hidden="true"></div>
 <div class="bot" aria-hidden="true"><div class="c"></div><div class="c"></div></div>
</header>

<section class="story" aria-label="The story">
 <article class="c"><span class="label">The painter</span><h2>Piet Mondrian</h2><p>Dutch painter, 1872-1944. In 1917 he founded the De Stijl movement in the Netherlands together with Theo van Doesburg.</p></article>
